  "text": "## Incident Categories & Severity  \n### Incident Types  \n**1. Cybersecurity Incident**\n- Malware infection\n- Ransomware attack\n- Unauthorized access\n- Data exfiltration\n- DDoS attack\n- Credential compromise  \n**2. Data Breach**\n- Customer personal data exposed\n- Financial data accessed\n- System/operational data leaked\n- Regulatory data breached  \n**3. System Incident**\n- System outage/unavailability\n- Data corruption\n- Performance degradation\n- Integration failure\n- Backup failure  \n**4. Physical Security Incident**\n- Facility breach\n- Equipment theft\n- Fire/environmental damage\n- Access control failure  \n**5. Fraud/Misconduct**\n- Unauthorized transactions\n- Employee fraud\n- Third-party fraud",
